-- books/grafema/book.rofl — the book of Grafema, grown by ontocrawler-2.
--
-- One seed, `grafema exists`. Every edge carries its volume in the bracket,
-- its evidence, the round it landed and an honest proof depth. Sections
-- marked `-- @who` are loaded under that identity by crawl.ts; the golden
-- loads the file whole and anonymous, which is also a valid world.
--
-- Vocabulary comes from books/crystals/: base.rofl (the skill's six
-- questions) and software-product.rofl (what this crawl added). Nothing
-- domain-specific is declared here; classes derive from is_a.

-- @who ontocrawler_2

